#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:24
msgid ""
"\n"
"Topology\n"
"\n"
"Management of a replication topology at domain level 1.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Topologia\n"
"\n"
"Gestió d'una topologia de replicació a nivell de domini 1.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:28
msgid ""
"\n"
"IPA server's data is stored in LDAP server in two suffixes:\n"
"* domain suffix, e.g., 'dc=example,dc=com', contains all domain related "
"data\n"
"* ca suffix, 'o=ipaca', is present only on server with CA installed. It\n"
"  contains data for Certificate Server component\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Les dades del servidor IPA s'emmagatzemen al servidor LDAP en dos sufixos:\n"
"* el sufix de domini, p. ex., 'dc,example,dc,com', conté totes les dades "
"relacionades amb el domini\n"
"* el sufix ca, 'o.ipaca', només està present al servidor amb la CA "
"instal·lada. It\n"
"  conté dades per al component del servidor de certificats\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:33
msgid ""
"\n"
"Data stored on IPA servers is replicated to other IPA servers. The way it "
"is\n"
"replicated is defined by replication agreements. Replication agreements "
"needs\n"
"to be set for both suffixes separately. On domain level 0 they are managed\n"
"using ipa-replica-manage and ipa-csreplica-manage tools. With domain level "
"1\n"
"they are managed centrally using `ipa topology*` commands.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Les dades emmagatzemades en els servidors IPA són replicats a altres "
"servidors IPA. La manera com és\n"
"La replicació es defineix per acords de replicació. Necessitats d'acords de "
"replicació\n"
"s'establirà per a ambdós sufixos per separat. En el nivell de domini 0 es "
"gestionen\n"
"utilitzar eines ipa-replica-manage i ipa-csreplica-manage. Amb domini nivell "
"1\n"
"es gestionen centralment utilitzant les ordres .topologia d'ipa*..\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:39
msgid ""
"\n"
"Agreements are represented by topology segments. By default topology "
"segment\n"
"represents 2 replication agreements - one for each direction, e.g., A to B "
"and\n"
"B to A. Creation of unidirectional segments is not allowed.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Els acords estan representats per segments topològics. Per defecte segment "
"de topologia\n"
"representa 2 acords de replicació - un per a cada direcció, per exemple, A a "
"B i\n"
"B a A. No es permet la creació de segments unidireccionals.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:43
msgid ""
"\n"
"To verify that no server is disconnected in the topology of the given "
"suffix,\n"
"use:\n"
"  ipa topologysuffix-verify $suffix\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Per verificar que cap servidor està desconnectat en la topologia del sufix "
"donat,\n"
"utilitza:\n"
"  ipa topologysuffix-verify $suffix\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:47
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  Find all IPA servers:\n"
"    ipa server-find\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Exemples:\n"
"  Troba tots els servidors IPA:\n"
"    ipa server-find\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:52
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Find all suffixes:\n"
"    ipa topologysuffix-find\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Troba tots els sufixos:\n"
"    topologia ipauffix-find\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:55
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Add topology segment to 'domain' suffix:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-add domain --left IPA_SERVER_A --right IPA_SERVER_B\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Afegeix un segment de topologia al sufix «domini»:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-add domini --left IPASERVERA --right IPASERVERB\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:58
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Add topology segment to 'ca' suffix:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-add ca --left IPA_SERVER_A --right IPA_SERVER_B\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Afegeix un segment topològic al sufix «ca»:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-add ca --left IPASERVERA --right IPASERVERB\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:61
msgid ""
"\n"
"  List all topology segments in 'domain' suffix:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-find domain\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Llista tots els segments de topologia en el sufix «domini»:\n"
"    domini ipa topologysegment-find\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:64
msgid ""
"\n"
"  List all topology segments in 'ca' suffix:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-find ca\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Llista tots els segments de topologia en el sufix «ca»:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-find ca\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:67
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Delete topology segment in 'domain' suffix:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-del domain segment_name\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Suprimeix el segment de topologia en el sufix «domini»:\n"
"    topologysegment-del domini segmentname\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:70
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Delete topology segment in 'ca' suffix:\n"
"    ipa topologysegment-del ca segment_name\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Suprimeix el segment de topologia en el sufix «ca»:\n"
"    topologysegment-del ca segmentname\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:73
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Verify topology of 'domain' suffix:\n"
"    ipa topologysuffix-verify domain\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Verifica la topologia del sufix «domini»:\n"
"    domini ipa topologysuffix-verify\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/topology.py:76
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Verify topology of 'ca' suffix:\n"
"    ipa topologysuffix-verify ca\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Verifica la topologia del sufix «ca»:\n"
"    ipa topologysuffix-verify ca\n"

