msgstr ""
"\n"
"Les CA estan habilitades en la creació, però el seu ús està subjecte a les "
"CA ACL llevat que\n"
"L'operador té permís per evitar els ACL de CA.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/ca.py:29
msgid ""
"\n"
"All CAs except the 'IPA' CA can be disabled or re-enabled.  Disabling a CA\n"
"prevents it from issuing certificates but does not affect the validity of "
"its\n"
"certificate.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Totes les CA excepte la CA 'IPA' es poden desactivar o tornar a habilitar.  "
"S'està inhabilitant una CA\n"
"impedeix que emeti certificats però no afecta la validesa de la seva\n"
"certificat.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/ca.py:33
msgid ""
"\n"
"CAs (all except the 'IPA' CA) can be deleted.  Deleting a CA causes its "
"signing\n"
"certificate to be revoked and its private key deleted.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Les CA (totes excepte la CA 'IPA') es poden eliminar.  Suprimir una CA fa "
"que se signi\n"
"certificat a revocar i la seva clau privada esborrada.\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/ca.py:38
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Create new CA, subordinate to the IPA CA (requires permission\n"
"  \"System: Add CA\"):\n"
"\n"
"    ipa ca-add puppet --desc \"Puppet\" \\\n"
"        --subject \"CN=Puppet CA,O=EXAMPLE.COM\"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Crea una CA nova, subordinada a la CA IPA (requereix permís\n"
"  \"Sistema: Afegeix una CA\"):\n"
"\n"
"    ipa ca-add titella --desc \"Puppet\" \\\n"
"        --subject \"CN\"Puppet CA,O\"EXAMPLE.COM\"\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/ca.py:44
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Disable a CA (requires permission \"System: Modify CA\"):\n"
"\n"
"    ipa ca-disable puppet\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Inhabilita una CA (requereix permís \"Sistema: Modifica la CA\"):\n"
"\n"
"    titella ipa ca-disable\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/ca.py:48
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Re-enable a CA (requires permission \"System: Modify CA\"):\n"
"\n"
"    ipa ca-enable puppet\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Torna a habilitar una CA (requereix permís \"Sistema: Modifica la CA\"):\n"
"\n"
"    titella ipa ca-enable\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/ca.py:52
msgid ""
"\n"
"  Delete a CA (requires permission \"System: Delete CA\"; also requires\n"
"  CA to be disabled first):\n"
"\n"
"    ipa ca-del puppet\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"  Suprimeix una CA (requereix permís \"System: Suprimeix CA\"; també "
"requereix\n"
"  CA a desactivar primer):\n"
"\n"
"    ipa ca-del titella\n"

