#: ipaserver/plugins/ping.py:26 ipaclient/remote_plugins/2_156/ping.py:19
msgid ""
"\n"
"Ping the remote IPA server to ensure it is running.\n"
"\n"
"The ping command sends an echo request to an IPA server. The server\n"
"returns its version information. This is used by an IPA client\n"
"to confirm that the server is available and accepting requests.\n"
"\n"
"The server from xmlrpc_uri in /etc/ipa/default.conf is contacted first.\n"
"If it does not respond then the client will contact any servers defined\n"
"by ldap SRV records in DNS.\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Ping an IPA server:\n"
"   ipa ping\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"   IPA server version 2.1.9. API version 2.20\n"
"   ------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
" Ping an IPA server verbosely:\n"
"   ipa -v ping\n"
"   ipa: INFO: trying https://ipa.example.com/ipa/xml\n"
"   ipa: INFO: Forwarding 'ping' to server 'https://ipa.example.com/ipa/xml'\n"
"   -----------------------------------------------------\n"
"   IPA server version 2.1.9. API version 2.20\n"
"   -----------------------------------------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Pingeu al servidor remot IPA per assegurar-vos que s'està executant.\n"
"\n"
"L'ordre ping envia una sol·licitud d'eco a un servidor IPA. El servidor\n"
"retorna la informació de la seva versió. Això és utilitzat per un client "
"IPA\n"
"per confirmar que el servidor està disponible i acceptant sol·licituds.\n"
"\n"
"Primer es contacta amb el servidor de xmlrpcuri a /etc/ipa/default.conf.\n"
"Si no respon, el client es posarà en contacte amb qualsevol servidor "
"definit\n"
"per ldap SRV registres en DNS.\n"
"\n"
"EXEMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Ping a un servidor IPA:\n"
"   ping ipa\n"
"   --------------\n"
"   Servidor IPA versió 2.1.9. API versió 2.20\n"
"   --------------\n"
"\n"
" Ping a un servidor IPA detalladament:\n"
"   ipa -v ping\n"
"   ipa: INFO: s'està provant https://ipa.example.com/ipa/xml\n"
"   ipa: INFO: Reenvia 'ping' al servidor 'https://ipa.example.com/ipa/xml'\n"
"   ----------------\n"
"   Servidor IPA versió 2.1.9. API versió 2.20\n"
"   ----------------\n"

#: ipaserver/plugins/ping.py:59 ipaclient/remote_plugins/2_49/ping.py:52
msgid "Ping a remote server."
msgstr "Ping un servidor remot."

#: ipaserver/plugins/hbacrule.py:39
msgid ""
"\n"
"Host-based access control\n"
"\n"
"Control who can access what services on what hosts. You\n"
"can use HBAC to control which users or groups can\n"
"access a service, or group of services, on a target host.\n"
"\n"
"You can also specify a category of users and target hosts.\n"
"This is currently limited to \"all\", but might be expanded in the\n"
"future.\n"
"\n"
"Target hosts in HBAC rules must be hosts managed by IPA.\n"
"\n"
"The available services and groups of services are controlled by the\n"
"hbacsvc and hbacsvcgroup plug-ins respectively.\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Create a rule, \"test1\", that grants all users access to the host "
"\"server\" from\n"
" anywhere:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add --usercat=all test1\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-host --hosts=server.example.com test1\n"
"\n"
" Display the properties of a named HBAC rule:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-show test1\n"
"\n"
" Create a rule for a specific service. This lets the user john access\n"
" the sshd service on any machine from any machine:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add --hostcat=all john_sshd\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-user --users=john john_sshd\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-service --hbacsvcs=sshd john_sshd\n"
"\n"
" Create a rule for a new service group. This lets the user john access\n"
" the FTP service on any machine from any machine:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvcgroup-add ftpers\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-add sftp\n"
"   ipa hbacsvcgroup-add-member --hbacsvcs=ftp --hbacsvcs=sftp ftpers\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add --hostcat=all john_ftp\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-user --users=john john_ftp\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-service --hbacsvcgroups=ftpers john_ftp\n"
"\n"
" Disable a named HBAC rule:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-disable test1\n"
"\n"
" Remove a named HBAC rule:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-del allow_server\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Control d'accés basat en l'amfitrió\n"
"\n"
"Controla qui pot accedir a quins serveis en quins amfitrions. Tu\n"
"pot utilitzar HBAC per controlar quins usuaris o grups poden\n"
"accedir a un servei, o grup de serveis, en un amfitrió objectiu.\n"
"\n"
"També podeu especificar una categoria d'usuaris i amfitrions de destinació.\n"
"Actualment es limita a \"tot\", però es podria ampliar a\n"
"futur.\n"
"\n"
"Els amfitrions destí en les regles HBAC han de ser amfitrions gestionats per "
"IPA.\n"
"\n"
"Els serveis i grups de serveis disponibles estan controlats per\n"
"Connectors hbacsvc i hbacsvcgroup respectivament.\n"
"\n"
"EXEMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Crea una regla, \"test1\", que permet a tots els usuaris accedir al "
"\"servidor\" de l'amfitrió des de\n"
" a qualsevol lloc:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add --usercat1tot test1\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-host --hosts.server.example.com test1\n"
"\n"
" Mostra les propietats d'una regla HBAC anomenada:\n"
"   prova de la presentació de l'hbacrule de l'ipa1\n"
"\n"
" Crea una regla per a un servei específic. Això permet a l'usuari accedir a "
"john\n"
" el servei sshd en qualsevol màquina des de qualsevol màquina:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add --hostcat=all johnsshd\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-user --users-john johnsshd\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-service --hbacsvcs-sshd johnsshd\n"
"\n"
" Crea una regla per a un nou grup de serveis. Això permet a l'usuari accedir "
"a john\n"
" el servei FTP en qualsevol màquina des de qualsevol màquina:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvcgroup-add ftpers\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-add sftp\n"
"   ipa hbacsvcgroup-add-member --hbacsvcs-ftp --hbacsvcs=sftp ftpers\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add --hostcat=all johnftp\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-user --userssjohn johnftp\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-add-service --hbacsvcgroupssftpers johnftp\n"
"\n"
" Desactiva una regla HBAC anomenada:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-disable test1\n"
"\n"
" Elimina una regla HBAC anomenada:\n"
"   ipa hbacrule-del allowerver\n"

