msgid ""
"\n"
"HBAC Services\n"
"\n"
"The PAM services that HBAC can control access to. The name used here\n"
"must match the service name that PAM is evaluating.\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Add a new HBAC service:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-add tftp\n"
"\n"
" Modify an existing HBAC service:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-mod --desc=\"TFTP service\" tftp\n"
"\n"
" Search for HBAC services. This example will return two results, the FTP\n"
" service and the newly-added tftp service:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-find ftp\n"
"\n"
" Delete an HBAC service:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-del tftp\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Serveis HBAC\n"
"\n"
"Els serveis PAM als quals HBAC pot controlar l'accés. El nom que s'utilitza "
"aquí\n"
"ha de coincidir amb el nom de servei que el PAM està avaluant.\n"
"\n"
"EXEMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix un servei HBAC nou:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-add tftp\n"
"\n"
" Modifica un servei HBAC existent:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-mod --desc\"\"Servei TFTP\" tftp\n"
"\n"
" Cerca de serveis HBAC. Aquest exemple retornarà dos resultats, el FTP\n"
" servei i servei tftp recentment afegit:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-find ftp\n"
"\n"
" Suprimeix un servei HBAC:\n"
"   ipa hbacsvc-del tftp\n"

msgid "Member of HBAC service groups"
msgstr "Membre de grups de serveis HBAC"

msgid "Results should contain primary key attribute only (\"service\")"
msgstr ""
"Els resultats han de contenir només l'atribut clau principal (\"servei\")"

msgid ""
"\n"
"IPA certificate operations\n"
"\n"
"Implements a set of commands for managing server SSL certificates.\n"
"\n"
"Certificate requests exist in the form of a Certificate Signing Request "
"(CSR)\n"
"in PEM format.\n"
"\n"
"If using the selfsign back end then the subject in the CSR needs to match\n"
"the subject configured in the server. The dogtag CA uses just the CN\n"
"value of the CSR and forces the rest of the subject.\n"
"\n"
"A certificate is stored with a service principal and a service principal\n"
"needs a host.\n"
"\n"
"In order to request a certificate:\n"
"\n"
"* The host must exist\n"
"* The service must exist (or you use the --add option to automatically add "
"it)\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Request a new certificate and add the principal:\n"
"   ipa cert-request --add --principal=HTTP/lion.example.com example.csr\n"
"\n"
" Retrieve an existing certificate:\n"
"   ipa cert-show 1032\n"
"\n"
" Revoke a certificate (see RFC 5280 for reason details):\n"
"   ipa cert-revoke --revocation-reason=6 1032\n"
"\n"
" Remove a certificate from revocation hold status:\n"
"   ipa cert-remove-hold 1032\n"
"\n"
" Check the status of a signing request:\n"
"   ipa cert-status 10\n"
"\n"
"IPA currently immediately issues (or declines) all certificate requests so\n"
"the status of a request is not normally useful. This is for future use\n"
"or the case where a CA does not immediately issue a certificate.\n"
"\n"
"The following revocation reasons are supported:\n"
"\n"
"    * 0 - unspecified\n"
"    * 1 - keyCompromise\n"
"    * 2 - cACompromise\n"
"    * 3 - affiliationChanged\n"
"    * 4 - superseded\n"
"    * 5 - cessationOfOperation\n"
"    * 6 - certificateHold\n"
"    * 8 - removeFromCRL\n"
"    * 9 - privilegeWithdrawn\n"
"    * 10 - aACompromise\n"
"\n"
"Note that reason code 7 is not used.  See RFC 5280 for more details:\n"
"\n"
"http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc5280.txt\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Operacions de certificat IPA\n"
"\n"
"Implementa un conjunt d'ordres per a gestionar certificats SSL del "
"servidor.\n"
"\n"
"Les sol·licituds de certificat existeixen en la forma d'una sol·licitud de "
"signatura de certificat (CSR)\n"
"en format PEM.\n"
"\n"
"Si s'utilitza el dorsal autosignat, llavors el subjecte de la RSC ha de "
"coincidir\n"
"l'assumpte configurat al servidor. El dogtag CA només utilitza el CN\n"
"Valor de la RSE i força la resta del subjecte.\n"
"\n"
"S'emmagatzema un certificat amb un director de servei i un director de "
"servei\n"
"Necessita un amfitrió.\n"
"\n"
"Per sol·licitar un certificat:\n"
"\n"
"* L'amfitrió ha d'existir\n"
"* El servei ha d'existir (o utilitzeu l'opció --add per afegir-lo "
"automàticament)\n"
"\n"
"EXEMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Sol·licita un certificat nou i afegeix el principal:\n"
"   ipa cert-request --add --principal/HTTP/lion.example.com example.csr\n"
"\n"
" Recupera un certificat existent:\n"
"   ipa cert-show 1032\n"
"\n"
" Revocar un certificat (veure RFC 5280 per detalls de raó):\n"
"   ipa cert-revoke --revocation-reason66 1032\n"
"\n"
" Elimina un certificat de l'estat de retenció de la revocació:\n"
"   ipa cert-remove-hold 1032\n"
"\n"
" Comprova l'estat d'una petició de signatura:\n"
"   ipa cert-status 10\n"
"\n"
"IPA actualment emet immediatament (o rebutja) totes les sol·licituds de "
"certificat\n"
"L'estat d'una sol·licitud normalment no és útil. Això és per a ús futur\n"
"o el cas en què una CA no emeti immediatament un certificat.\n"
"\n"
"S'admeten les següents raons de revocació:\n"
"\n"
"    * 0 - no especificat\n"
"    * 1 - keyCompromise\n"
"    * 2 - cACompromise\n"
"    * 3 - affiliationChanged\n"
"    * 4 - reemplaçat\n"
"    * 5 - cessationOfOperation\n"
"    * 6 - certificatHold\n"
"    * 8 - removeFromCRL\n"
"    * 9 - privilegeWithdrawn\n"
"    * 10 - aACompromise\n"
"\n"
"Tingueu en compte que el codi de raó 7 no s'utilitza.  Vegeu RFC 5280 per a "
"més detalls:\n"
"\n"
"http://www.ietf.org/rfc/rfc5280.txt\n"

msgid "Service principal for this certificate (e.g. HTTP/test.example.com)"
msgstr ""
"Principal del servei per a aquest certificat (p. ex. HTTP/test.example.com)"

msgid "automatically add the principal if it doesn't exist"
msgstr "afegeix automàticament el principal si no existeix"

msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Raó"

msgid "Reason for revoking the certificate (0-10)"
msgstr "Motiu per a revocar el certificat (0-10)"

msgid ""
"\n"
"Auto Membership Rule.\n"
"\n"
"Bring clarity to the membership of hosts and users by configuring inclusive\n"
"or exclusive regex patterns, you can automatically assign a new entries "
"into\n"
"a group or hostgroup based upon attribute information.\n"
"\n"
"A rule is directly associated with a group by name, so you cannot create\n"
"a rule without an accompanying group or hostgroup.\n"
"\n"
"A condition is a regular expression used by 389-ds to match a new incoming\n"
"entry with an automember rule. If it matches an inclusive rule then the\n"
"entry is added to the appropriate group or hostgroup.\n"
"\n"
"A default group or hostgroup could be specified for entries that do not\n"
"match any rule. In case of user entries this group will be a fallback group\n"
"because all users are by default members of group specified in IPA config.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Add the initial group or hostgroup:\n"
"   ipa hostgroup-add --desc=\"Web Servers\" webservers\n"
"   ipa group-add --desc=\"Developers\" devel\n"
"\n"
" Add the initial rule:\n"
"   ipa automember-add --type=hostgroup webservers\n"
"   ipa automember-add --type=group devel\n"
"\n"
" Add a condition to the rule:\n"
"   ipa automember-add-condition --key=fqdn --type=hostgroup --inclusive-"
"regex=^web[1-9]+\\.example\\.com webservers\n"
"   ipa automember-add-condition --key=manager --type=group --inclusive-"
"regex=^uid=mscott devel\n"
"\n"
" Add an exclusive condition to the rule to prevent auto assignment:\n"
"   ipa automember-add-condition --key=fqdn --type=hostgroup --exclusive-"
"regex=^web5\\.example\\.com webservers\n"
"\n"
" Add a host:\n"
"    ipa host-add web1.example.com\n"
"\n"
" Add a user:\n"
"    ipa user-add --first=Tim --last=User --password tuser1 --manager=mscott\n"
"\n"
" Verify automembership:\n"
"    ipa hostgroup-show webservers\n"
"      Host-group: webservers\n"
"      Description: Web Servers\n"
"      Member hosts: web1.example.com\n"
"\n"
"    ipa group-show devel\n"
"      Group name: devel\n"
"      Description: Developers\n"
"      GID: 1004200000\n"
"      Member users: tuser\n"
"\n"
" Remove a condition from the rule:\n"
"   ipa automember-remove-condition --key=fqdn --type=hostgroup --inclusive-"
"regex=^web[1-9]+\\.example\\.com webservers\n"
"\n"
" Modify the automember rule:\n"
"    ipa automember-mod\n"
"\n"
" Set the default (fallback) target group:\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-set --default-group=webservers --"
"type=hostgroup\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-set --default-group=ipausers --type=group\n"
"\n"
" Remove the default (fallback) target group:\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-remove --type=hostgroup\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-remove --type=group\n"
"\n"
" Show the default (fallback) target group:\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-show --type=hostgroup\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-show --type=group\n"
"\n"
" Find all of the automember rules:\n"
"    ipa automember-find\n"
"\n"
" Display a automember rule:\n"
"    ipa automember-show --type=hostgroup webservers\n"
"    ipa automember-show --type=group devel\n"
"\n"
" Delete an automember rule:\n"
"    ipa automember-del --type=hostgroup webservers\n"
"    ipa automember-del --type=group devel\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Regla de pertinença automàtica.\n"
"\n"
"Aporta claredat a la pertinença dels amfitrions i usuaris mitjançant la "
"configuració inclusiva\n"
"o patrons exclusius d'expressió regular, podeu assignar automàticament una "
"entrada nova a\n"
"un grup o grup d'amfitrions basat en la informació de l'atribut.\n"
"\n"
"Una regla s'associa directament amb un grup per nom, de manera que no podeu "
"crear\n"
"una regla sense un grup d'acompanyament o un grup d'amfitrions.\n"
"\n"
"Una condició és una expressió regular utilitzada per 389-ds per coincidir "
"amb una nova entrada\n"
"entrada amb una regla de membre automàtic. Si coincideix amb una regla "
"inclusiva, llavors\n"
"l'entrada s'afegeix al grup o grup d'amfitrions apropiat.\n"
"\n"
"Es pot especificar un grup o un grup d'amfitrions per defecte per a les "
"entrades que no\n"
"coincideix amb qualsevol regla. En cas d'entrades d'usuari aquest grup serà "
"un grup alternatiu\n"
"perquè tots els usuaris són per defecte membres del grup especificat a la "
"configuració IPA.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"EXEMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix el grup inicial o el grup d'amfitrions:\n"
"   ipa hostgroup-add --descs\"Servidors web\"\n"
"   ipa group-add --desc\"\"Developers\" devel\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix la regla inicial:\n"
"   ipa automember-add --type=hostgroup webservers\n"
"   ipa automember-add --type=group devel\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix una condició a la regla:\n"
"   ipa automember-add-condition --key.fqdn --type.hostgroup --inclusive-"
"regex.web[1-9]+\\.example\\.com webservers\n"
"   ipa automember-add-condition --key-manager --type-group --inclusive-regex-"
"uid-mscott devel\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix una condició exclusiva a la regla per evitar l'assignació "
"automàtica:\n"
"   ipa automember-add-condition --key.fqdn --type.hostgroup --exclusive-"
"regex.web5\\.example\\.com webservers\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix un amfitrió:\n"
"    ipa host-add web1.example.com\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix un usuari:\n"
"    ipa user-add --first-Tim --last=User --password tuser1 --manager=mscott\n"
"\n"
" Verifica la pertinença automàtica:\n"
"    Servidors web de hostgroup-show d'ipa\n"
"      Grup d'amfitrions: servidors web\n"
"      Descripció: Servidors web\n"
"      Amfitrions membres: web1.example.com\n"
"\n"
"    Devel de la presentació de grup ipa\n"
"      Nom del grup: devel\n"
"      Descripció: desenvolupadors\n"
"      GID: 1004200000\n"
"      Usuaris membres: tuser\n"
"\n"
" Elimina una condició de la regla:\n"
"   ipa automember-remove-condition --key.fqdn --type.hostgroup --inclusive-"
"regex.web[1-9]+\\.example\\.com webservers\n"
"\n"
" Modifica la regla del membre automàtic:\n"
"    ipa automember-mod\n"
"\n"
" Estableix el grup de destinació predeterminat (fallback):\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-set --default-group=webservers --"
"type=hostgroup\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-set --default-group=ipausers --type=group\n"
"\n"
" Elimina el grup de destinació predeterminat (fallback):\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-remove --type=hostgroup\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-remove --type=group\n"
"\n"
" Mostra el grup de destinació predeterminat (fallback):\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-show --type=hostgroup\n"
"    ipa automember-default-group-show --type=group\n"
"\n"
" Troba totes les regles de l'automembrament:\n"
"    Ipa automember-find\n"
"\n"
" Mostra una regla de membre automàtic:\n"
"    ipa automember-show --type=hostgroup webservers\n"
"    ipa automember-show --type=group devel\n"
"\n"
" Suprimeix una regla de membre automàtic:\n"
"    ipa automember-del --type=hostgroup webservers\n"
"    ipa automember-del --type=group devel\n"

msgid "Add an automember rule."
msgstr "Afegeix una regla de membre automàtic."

msgid "Add conditions to an automember rule."
msgstr "Afegeix condicions a una regla de membre automàtic."

msgid "Remove default (fallback) group for all unmatched entries."
msgstr ""
"Elimina el grup predeterminat (fallback) per a totes les entrades no "
"coincidents."

msgid "Set default (fallback) group for all unmatched entries."
msgstr ""
"Estableix el grup predeterminat (fallback) per a totes les entrades no "
"coincidents."

msgid "Display information about the default (fallback) automember groups."
msgstr ""
"Mostra informació sobre els grups d'automòbils predeterminats (fallback)."

msgid "Delete an automember rule."
msgstr "Suprimeix una regla de membre automàtic."

msgid "Search for automember rules."
msgstr "Cerca regles d'automembrament."

msgid "Modify an automember rule."
msgstr "Modifica una regla de membre automàtic."

msgid "Remove conditions from an automember rule."
msgstr "Elimina les condicions d'una regla de membre automàtic."

msgid "Display information about an automember rule."
msgstr "Mostra informació sobre una regla de membre automàtic."

msgid ""
"\n"
"Cross-realm trusts\n"
"\n"
"Manage trust relationship between IPA and Active Directory domains.\n"
"\n"
"In order to allow users from a remote domain to access resources in IPA\n"
"domain, trust relationship needs to be established. Currently IPA supports\n"
"only trusts between IPA and Active Directory domains under control of "
"Windows\n"
"Server 2008 or later, with functional level 2008 or later.\n"
"\n"
"Please note that DNS on both IPA and Active Directory domain sides should "
"be\n"
"configured properly to discover each other. Trust relationship relies on\n"
"ability to discover special resources in the other domain via DNS records.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"\n"
"1. Establish cross-realm trust with Active Directory using AD administrator\n"
"   credentials:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trust-add --type=ad <ad.domain> --admin <AD domain administrator> --"
"password\n"
"\n"
"2. List all existing trust relationships:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trust-find\n"
"\n"
"3. Show details of the specific trust relationship:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trust-show <ad.domain>\n"
"\n"
"4. Delete existing trust relationship:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trust-del <ad.domain>\n"
"\n"
"Once trust relationship is established, remote users will need to be mapped\n"
"to local POSIX groups in order to actually use IPA resources. The mapping "
"should\n"
"be done via use of external membership of non-POSIX group and then this "
"group\n"
"should be included into one of local POSIX groups.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"1. Create group for the trusted domain admins' mapping and their local POSIX "
"group:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add --desc='<ad.domain> admins external map' ad_admins_external "
"--external\n"
"   ipa group-add --desc='<ad.domain> admins' ad_admins\n"
"\n"
"2. Add security identifier of Domain Admins of the <ad.domain> to the "
"ad_admins_external\n"
"   group:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add-member ad_admins_external --external 'AD\\Domain Admins'\n"
"\n"
"3. Allow members of ad_admins_external group to be associated with ad_admins "
"POSIX group:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add-member ad_admins --groups ad_admins_external\n"
"\n"
"4. List members of external members of ad_admins_external group to see their "
"SIDs:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-show ad_admins_external\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"GLOBAL TRUST CONFIGURATION\n"
"\n"
"When IPA AD trust subpackage is installed and ipa-adtrust-install is run,\n"
"a local domain configuration (SID, GUID, NetBIOS name) is generated. These\n"
"identifiers are then used when communicating with a trusted domain of the\n"
"particular type.\n"
"\n"
"1. Show global trust configuration for Active Directory type of trusts:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trustconfig-show --type ad\n"
"\n"
"2. Modify global configuration for all trusts of Active Directory type and "
"set\n"
"   a different fallback primary group (fallback primary group GID is used "
"as\n"
"   a primary user GID if user authenticating to IPA domain does not have any "
"other\n"
"   primary GID already set):\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trustconfig-mod --type ad --fallback-primary-group \"alternative AD "
"group\"\n"
"\n"
"3. Change primary fallback group back to default hidden group (any group "
"with\n"
"   posixGroup object class is allowed):\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trustconfig-mod --type ad --fallback-primary-group \"Default SMB "
"Group\"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"trusts de realitat creuada\n"
"\n"
"Gestiona la relació de confiança entre els dominis IPA i Active Directory.\n"
"\n"
"Per tal de permetre als usuaris d'un domini remot accedir a recursos d'IPA\n"
"domini, cal establir una relació de confiança. Suports IPA actuals\n"
"només confia entre els dominis IPA i Active Directory sota control de "
"Windows\n"
"Servidor 2008 o posterior, amb nivell funcional 2008 o posterior.\n"
"\n"
"Tingueu en compte que DNS tant en el costat IPA com en el domini Directori "
"Actiu hauria de ser\n"
"configurat adequadament per descobrir-se mútuament. La relació de confiança "
"es basa en\n"
"Capacitat per descobrir recursos especials en l'altre domini a través de "
"registres DNS.\n"
"\n"
"Exemples:\n"
"\n"
"1. Estableix la confiança entre reialmes amb el directori actiu usant "
"l'administrador d'anuncis\n"
"   credencials:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trust-add --type=ad <ad.domain> --admin <AD domain administrator> --"
"password\n"
"\n"
"2. Llista totes les relacions de confiança existents:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trust-find\n"
"\n"
"3. Mostra els detalls de la relació de confiança específica:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trust-show <ad.domain>\n"
"\n"
"4. Suprimeix la relació de confiança existent:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trust-del <ad.domain>\n"
"\n"
"Un cop establerta la relació de confiança, els usuaris remots hauran de ser "
"mapejats\n"
"als grups POSIX locals per tal d'utilitzar realment els recursos IPA. El "
"mapatge hauria de\n"
"es fa mitjançant l'ús d'afiliació externa del grup no-POSIX i després aquest "
"grup\n"
"s'ha d'incloure en un dels grups POSIX locals.\n"
"\n"
"Exemple:\n"
"\n"
"1. Crea un grup per al mapatge dels administradors de domini de confiança i "
"el seu grup POSIX local:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add --descs'<ad.domain> admins external map' adadminsexternal --"
"external\n"
"   ipa group-add --descs'<ad.domain> admins' adadmins\n"
"\n"
"2. Afegeix l'identificador de seguretat dels administradors de domini del "
"<ad.domain> a l'adadminsexternal\n"
"   grup:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add-member adadminsexternal --external 'AD\\Domain Admins'\n"
"\n"
"3. Permet que els membres del grup adadminsextern s'associïn amb el grup "
"POSIX d'adadmins:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add-member adadmins --groups adadminsexternal\n"
"\n"
"4. Llista els membres externs del grup adadminsexternal per veure els seus "
"SID:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-show adadminsexternal\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"CONFIGURACIÓ DE LA CONFIANÇA GLOBAL\n"
"\n"
"Quan el subpaquet de confiança IPA AD està instal·lat i s'executa ipa-"
"adtrust-install,\n"
"es genera una configuració de domini local (SID, GUID, nom NetBIOS). "
"Aquests\n"
"Els identificadors s'utilitzen quan es comuniquen amb un domini de "
"confiança\n"
"tipus particular.\n"
"\n"
"1. Mostra la configuració global de confiança per al tipus de confiança "
"Active Directory:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trustconfig-show --type ad\n"
"\n"
"2. Modifica la configuració global per a totes les fideïcomisions del tipus "
"i conjunt de directoris actius\n"
"   un grup primari alternatiu diferent (el grup primari alternatiu GID "
"s'utilitza com\n"
"   un GID d'usuari primari si l'usuari que s'està autenticant al domini IPA "
"no té cap altre\n"
"   GID primari ja establert:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trustconfig-mod --type ad --fallback-primary-group \"alternative AD "
"group\"\n"
"\n"
"3. Canvia el grup alternatiu primari al grup ocult predeterminat (qualsevol "
"grup amb\n"
"   la classe d'objecte posixGroup està permesa):\n"
"\n"
"   ipa trustconfig-mod --type ad --fallback-primary-group \"Default SMB "
"Group\"\n"

msgid "SID blacklist incoming"
msgstr "Entrada de la llista negra del SID"

msgid "SID blacklist outgoing"
msgstr "Sortida de la llista negra del SID"

msgid ""
"\n"
"Add new trust to use.\n"
"\n"
"This command establishes trust relationship to another domain\n"
"which becomes 'trusted'. As result, users of the trusted domain\n"
"may access resources of this domain.\n"
"\n"
"Only trusts to Active Directory domains are supported right now.\n"
"\n"
"The command can be safely run multiple times against the same domain,\n"
"this will cause change to trust relationship credentials on both\n"
"sides.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Afegeix una confiança nova a utilitzar.\n"
"\n"
"Aquesta ordre estableix una relació de confiança amb un altre domini\n"
"que es fa \"de confiança\". Com a resultat, usuaris del domini de confiança\n"
"pot accedir a recursos d'aquest domini.\n"
"\n"
"Ara mateix només s'admet la confiança en els dominis de directori actiu.\n"
"\n"
"L'ordre es pot executar amb seguretat diverses vegades contra el mateix "
"domini,\n"
"Això causarà canvis en les credencials de la relació de confiança en tots "
"dos\n"
"COSTATS.\n"
"    "

msgid "Active directory domain administrator's password"
msgstr "Domini d'Active Directory"

msgid "Results should contain primary key attribute only (\"realm\")"
msgstr "Els resultats han de contenir només l'atribut clau principal («realm»)"

msgid ""
"\n"
"Modify a trust (for future use).\n"
"\n"
"    Currently only the default option to modify the LDAP attributes is\n"
"    available. More specific options will be added in coming releases.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Modifica una confiança (per a ús futur).\n"
"\n"
"    Actualment només l'opció predeterminada per modificar els atributs LDAP "
"és\n"
"    disponible. En les properes versions s'afegiran opcions més "
"específiques.\n"
"    "

msgid ""
"\n"
"Self-service Permissions\n"
"\n"
"A permission enables fine-grained delegation of permissions. Access Control\n"
"Rules, or instructions (ACIs), grant permission to permissions to perform\n"
"given tasks such as adding a user, modifying a group, etc.\n"
"\n"
"A Self-service permission defines what an object can change in its own "
"entry.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Add a self-service rule to allow users to manage their address:\n"
"   ipa selfservice-add --permissions=write --attrs=street,postalCode,l,c,st "
"\"Users manage their own address\"\n"
"\n"
" When managing the list of attributes you need to include all attributes\n"
" in the list, including existing ones. Add telephoneNumber to the list:\n"
"   ipa selfservice-mod --attrs=street,postalCode,l,c,st,telephoneNumber "
"\"Users manage their own address\"\n"
"\n"
" Display our updated rule:\n"
"   ipa selfservice-show \"Users manage their own address\"\n"
"\n"
" Delete a rule:\n"
"   ipa selfservice-del \"Users manage their own address\"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Permisos d'autoservei\n"
"\n"
"Un permís permet la delegació de permisos de gra fi. Control d'accés\n"
"Regles, o instruccions (ACIs), concedeixen permís als permisos per "
"realitzar\n"
"tasques donades com afegir un usuari, modificar un grup, etc.\n"
"\n"
"Un permís d'autoservei defineix el que un objecte pot canviar en la seva "
"pròpia entrada.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"EXEMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix una regla d'autoservei per permetre als usuaris gestionar la seva "
"adreça:\n"
"   ipa selfservice-add --permissions\"write --"
"attrs\"street,postalCode,l,c,st \"Els usuaris gestionen la seva pròpia "
"adreça\"\n"
"\n"
" Quan gestioneu la llista d'atributs, heu d'incloure tots els atributs\n"
" a la llista, inclosos els existents. Afegeix el numerador de telèfon a la "
"llista:\n"
"   ipa selfservice-mod --attrs\"street,postalCode,l,c,st,telephoneNumber "
"\"Els usuaris gestionen la seva pròpia adreça\"\n"
"\n"
" Mostra la nostra regla actualitzada:\n"
"   ipa selfservice-show \"Els usuaris gestionen la seva pròpia adreça\"\n"
"\n"
" Suprimeix una regla:\n"
"   ipa selfservice-del \"Els usuaris gestionen la seva pròpia adreça\"\n"

msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of permissions to grant (read, write). Default is write."
msgstr ""
"Llista separada per comes de permisos per concedir (llegir, escriure). Per "
"defecte s'escriu."

msgid ""
"\n"
"Groups of users\n"
"\n"
"Manage groups of users. By default, new groups are POSIX groups. You\n"
"can add the --nonposix option to the group-add command to mark a new group\n"
"as non-POSIX. You can use the --posix argument with the group-mod command\n"
"to convert a non-POSIX group into a POSIX group. POSIX groups cannot be\n"
"converted to non-POSIX groups.\n"
"\n"
"Every group must have a description.\n"
"\n"
"POSIX groups must have a Group ID (GID) number. Changing a GID is\n"
"supported but can have an impact on your file permissions. It is not "
"necessary\n"
"to supply a GID when creating a group. IPA will generate one automatically\n"
"if it is not provided.\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Add a new group:\n"
"   ipa group-add --desc='local administrators' localadmins\n"
"\n"
" Add a new non-POSIX group:\n"
"   ipa group-add --nonposix --desc='remote administrators' remoteadmins\n"
"\n"
" Convert a non-POSIX group to posix:\n"
"   ipa group-mod --posix remoteadmins\n"
"\n"
" Add a new POSIX group with a specific Group ID number:\n"
"   ipa group-add --gid=500 --desc='unix admins' unixadmins\n"
"\n"
" Add a new POSIX group and let IPA assign a Group ID number:\n"
"   ipa group-add --desc='printer admins' printeradmins\n"
"\n"
" Remove a group:\n"
"   ipa group-del unixadmins\n"
"\n"
" To add the \"remoteadmins\" group to the \"localadmins\" group:\n"
"   ipa group-add-member --groups=remoteadmins localadmins\n"
"\n"
" Add a list of users to the \"localadmins\" group:\n"
"   ipa group-add-member --users=test1,test2 localadmins\n"
"\n"
" Remove a user from the \"localadmins\" group:\n"
"   ipa group-remove-member --users=test2 localadmins\n"
"\n"
" Display information about a named group.\n"
"   ipa group-show localadmins\n"
"\n"
"External group membership is designed to allow users from trusted domains\n"
"to be mapped to local POSIX groups in order to actually use IPA resources.\n"
"External members should be added to groups that specifically created as\n"
"external and non-POSIX. Such group later should be included into one of "
"POSIX\n"
"groups.\n"
"\n"
"An external group member is currently a Security Identifier (SID) as defined "
"by\n"
"the trusted domain. When adding external group members, it is possible to\n"
"specify them in either SID, or DOM\\name, or name@domain format. IPA will "
"attempt\n"
"to resolve passed name to SID with the use of Global Catalog of the trusted "
"domain.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"1. Create group for the trusted domain admins' mapping and their local POSIX "
"group:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add --desc='<ad.domain> admins external map' ad_admins_external "
"--external\n"
"   ipa group-add --desc='<ad.domain> admins' ad_admins\n"
"\n"
"2. Add security identifier of Domain Admins of the <ad.domain> to the "
"ad_admins_external\n"
"   group:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add-member ad_admins_external --external 'AD\\Domain Admins'\n"
"\n"
"3. Allow members of ad_admins_external group to be associated with ad_admins "
"POSIX group:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add-member ad_admins --groups ad_admins_external\n"
"\n"
"4. List members of external members of ad_admins_external group to see their "
"SIDs:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-show ad_admins_external\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Grups d'usuaris\n"
"\n"
"Gestiona grups d'usuaris. Per defecte, els grups nous són grups POSIX. Tu\n"
"pot afegir l'opció --nonposix a l'ordre group-add per a marcar un grup nou\n"
"com a no-POSIX. Podeu utilitzar l'argument --posix amb l'ordre group-mod\n"
"per a convertir un grup no-POSIX en un grup POSIX. els grups POSIX no poden "
"ser\n"
"s'ha convertit en grups no-POSIX.\n"
"\n"
"Cada grup ha de tenir una descripció.\n"
"\n"
"Els grups POSIX han de tenir un número ID de grup (GID). Canviar un GID és\n"
"S'admet però pot tenir un impacte en els permisos dels fitxers. No és "
"necessari\n"
"per a subministrar un GID en crear un grup. IPA en generarà un "
"automàticament\n"
"si no es proporciona.\n"
"\n"
"EXEMPLES:\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix un grup nou:\n"
"   ipa group-add --descs'administradors locals' administradors\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix un grup nou que no siguiPOSIX:\n"
"   ipa group-add --nonposix --descs'remote administrators' remoteadmins\n"
"\n"
" Converteix un grup no-POSIX en posix:\n"
"   ipa group-mod --posix remoteadmins\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix un grup POSIX nou amb un número ID de grup específic:\n"
"   ipa group-add --gids500 --descs'unix admins' unixadmins\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix un grup POSIX nou i deixa que IPA assigni un número ID de grup:\n"
"   ipa group-add --descs'printer admins' printeradmins\n"
"\n"
" Elimina un grup:\n"
"   ipa group-del unixadmins\n"
"\n"
" Per a afegir el grup «remoteadmins» al grup «localadmins»:\n"
"   ipa group-add-member --groupssremoteadmins localadmins\n"
"\n"
" Afegeix una llista d'usuaris al grup «localadmins»:\n"
"   ipa group-add-member --usersstest1,test2 localadmins\n"
"\n"
" Elimina un usuari del grup «localadmins»:\n"
"   ipa group-remove-member --usersstest2 localadmins\n"
"\n"
" Mostra informació sobre un grup anomenat.\n"
"   mostra els administradors locals de l'ipa\n"
"\n"
"La pertinença a un grup extern està dissenyada per permetre als usuaris de "
"dominis de confiança\n"
"per ser mapejat a grups POSIX locals per tal d'utilitzar realment els "
"recursos IPA.\n"
"Els membres externs s'han d'afegir als grups que específicament van crear "
"com\n"
"extern i no-POSIX. Aquest grup més tard s'hauria d'incloure en un de POSIX\n"
"grups.\n"
"\n"
"Un membre extern del grup és actualment un Identificador de Seguretat (SID) "
"definit per\n"
"el domini de confiança. En afegir membres externs del grup, és possible\n"
"especifiqueu-los en format SID, DOM\\n"
"ame o name.domain. IPA intentarà\n"
"per resoldre el nom passat al SID amb l'ús del Catàleg Global del domini de "
"confiança.\n"
"\n"
"Exemple:\n"
"\n"
"1. Crea un grup per al mapatge dels administradors de domini de confiança i "
"el seu grup POSIX local:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add --descs'<ad.domain> admins external map' adadminsexternal --"
"external\n"
"   ipa group-add --descs'<ad.domain> admins' adadmins\n"
"\n"
"2. Afegeix l'identificador de seguretat dels administradors de domini del "
"<ad.domain> a l'adadminsexternal\n"
"   grup:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add-member adadminsexternal --external 'AD\\Domain Admins'\n"
"\n"
"3. Permet que els membres del grup adadminsextern s'associïn amb el grup "
"POSIX d'adadmins:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-add-member adadmins --groups adadminsexternal\n"
"\n"
"4. Llista els membres externs del grup adadminsexternal per veure els seus "
"SID:\n"
"\n"
"   ipa group-show adadminsexternal\n"

