msgid ""
"\n"
"Manage CA ACL rules.\n"
"\n"
"This plugin is used to define rules governing which principals are\n"
"permitted to have certificates issued using a given certificate\n"
"profile.\n"
"\n"
"PROFILE ID SYNTAX:\n"
"\n"
"A Profile ID is a string without spaces or punctuation starting with a "
"letter\n"
"and followed by a sequence of letters, digits or underscore (\"_\").\n"
"\n"
"EXAMPLES:\n"
"\n"
"  Create a CA ACL \"test\" that grants all users access to the\n"
"  \"UserCert\" profile:\n"
"    ipa caacl-add test --usercat=all\n"
"    ipa caacl-add-profile test --certprofiles UserCert\n"
"\n"
"  Display the properties of a named CA ACL:\n"
"    ipa caacl-show test\n"
"\n"
"  Create a CA ACL to let user \"alice\" use the \"DNP3\" profile:\n"
"    ipa caacl-add-profile alice_dnp3 --certprofiles DNP3\n"
"    ipa caacl-add-user alice_dnp3 --user=alice\n"
"\n"
"  Disable a CA ACL:\n"
"    ipa caacl-disable test\n"
"\n"
"  Remove a CA ACL:\n"
"    ipa caacl-del test\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Gestiona les regles CA ACL.\n"
"\n"
"Aquest connector s'utilitza per definir les regles que regeixen quins són "
"els principals\n"
"es permet l'emissió de certificats mitjançant un certificat donat\n"
"Perfil.\n"
"\n"
"SINTAXI DE L'ID DEL PERFIL:\n"
"\n"
"Un ID de perfil és una cadena sense espais o puntuació que comença amb una "
"lletra\n"
"i seguit d'una seqüència de lletres, dígits o guió baix (\"\").\n"
"\n"
"EXEMPLES:\n"
"\n"
"  Crea una \"prova\" de CA ACL que permeti a tots els usuaris accedir a\n"
"  Perfil «UserCert»:\n"
"    ipa caacl-add test --usercat-all\n"
"    ipa caacl-add-profile test --certprofiles UserCert\n"
"\n"
"  Mostra les propietats d'una CA ACL anomenada:\n"
"    prova de l'apa caacl-show\n"
"\n"
"  Crea una CA ACL per a permetre a l'usuari \"alícia\" utilitzar el perfil "
"\"DNP3\":\n"
"    ipa caacl-add-profile alicednp3 --certprofiles DNP3\n"
"    ipa caacl-add-user alicednp3 --user=alice\n"
"\n"
"  Inhabilita una ACL de CA:\n"
"    prova d'inhabilitació de caacl d'ipa\n"
"\n"
"  Elimina una ACL de CA:\n"
"    prova ipa caacl-del\n"

